# Model-weight routing

- Mechanical work (search, format, boilerplate) → light model.
- Bounded implementation with a named test → medium model.
- Judgment, architecture, ambiguous root-cause, money/security paths, and every review/audit/exam → strongest model available this turn.
- When in doubt: higher tier if the answer is not independently verifiable; lower tier if a test or probe will catch a miss.
- A light-model pass is not a review. Confident-wrong on judgment costs more than the tokens saved.

Gate: `assertModelWeight` in `src/lib/model-weight-routing.ts`.
